StatRotationLoadedPortion [SimTalk] - Turnplate
Returns the portion of the statistics collection period during which the Turnplate designated by <Path> was
rotating while a MU was located on the plate.
Syntax
<Path>.StatRotationLoadedPortion → real
Return Value
The return value has the data type real.
Example
print MyTurnplate.StatRotationLoadedPortion
See also
Tab Statistics [Turnplate]
Statistics report, Rotation Time
StatRotationLoadedPortion [SimTalk] - Turnplate
11-2424 Plant Simulation Help
Unpublished work. © 2026 Siemens

StatRotationLoadedTime [SimTalk] - Turnplate
Returns the total time during which the Turnplate designated by <Path> was rotating while a MU was
located on the plate.
Syntax
<Path>.StatRotationLoadedTime → time
Return Value
The return value has the data type time.
Example
print MyTurnplate.StatRotationLoadedTime
See also
Statistics report, Rotation Time
